182 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Team\054\nI design B2B products where the data is money\072 sales compensation at Remuner\054 financial planning at Abacum\056 At Abacum I designed the Dataset Manager\054 a UI layer over JSON dataset configuration that let finance teams set up their data without engineering support\054 and standardised the formula syntax of the modeling layer\056 Getting complex\054 dependency\055heavy flows right is the work I look for\054 and payroll is full of it\056\nYour requirements name design tokens explicitly\054 which is rare\056 I have built two production design systems\054 including the token pipeline from Token Studio through Style Dictionary to a published npm package with CI validation\056 On the AI side\054 I designed an agent released to all Remuner customers\054 where sales reps and managers consult their commission data in plain language\056\nI am in Barcelona and the hybrid setup works for me\056 Portfolio\072 manel\055leiva\056com\056\nBest\054\050Manel)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 181 0 R
     /Pg 176 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

